    <string name="assistive_ball_says_hey_gotcha_the_bundled">Says \"Hey Gotcha\" — the bundled OpenWakeWord model runs on-device, but only while the Assistive Ball is on and no call is active. The listener lives inside the ball\'s service, so switching the ball off switches the wake word off too. Keep microphone permission enabled.</string>
