    <string name="assistive_ball_lower_values_are_stricter_fewer">Lower values are stricter — fewer false activations in TV or music; higher values catch the word from further away or with weaker pronunciation.</string>
    <string name="assistive_ball_needs_the_display_over_other">Needs the \"Display over other apps\" permission — turning this on the first time takes you there to grant it.</string>
    <string name="assistive_ball_some_phones_keep_the_night">Some phones keep the Night Light tint in screenshots. With this on, a screenshot or Screen Lens capture from the ball turns Night Light off, waits a few seconds for the colours to settle, captures, and turns it back on. The screen shows its normal colours meanwhile.</string>
